WEBVTT

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:02.880
My name is Taiki Kudou.

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:06.450
I was taken to this mysterious 
place called the Digital World,

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:08.220
where I met Shoutmon

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.790
and the other creatures of 
this world, called Digimon.

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:14.520
This world is having a lot of trouble

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:16.590
with the attacking Bagra Army.

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:19.160
We arrived in the Sweets Zone,

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.030
where we defeated WaruMonzaemon

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:22.130
in a sweets-making battle.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:25.770
But then, just after we 
freed the patissiers,

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:28.890
Matadormon sent us 
tumbling into an abyss.

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:48.010
<b>Ultimate Weapon Activated!</b>

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:48.010
<b>You Can Do It, Cutemon!</b>

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:45.610
Ultimate Weapon Activated! 
You Can Do It, Cutemon!

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:04.160
Ouch...

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:06.570
Are you all right, Nene?

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:08.240
I'm fine.

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:09.950
What about you?

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:14.120
Sorry about that.

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:15.690
But...

00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:18.420
Where are we?

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:27.500
This is the giant shredder 
beneath the town.

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:30.140
It's where we destroy waste data.

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:32.640
<i>I'm</i> gonna be destroyed! Get off!

00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:36.890
That hurts!

00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:40.480
Boys aren't supposed to cry!

00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:42.830
Leave this to Cutemon!

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:45.000
I'm Cu-Cu-Cu-Cutemon!

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.900
Kizunaol!

00:01:52.580 --> 00:01:54.950
Ah, that's better.

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:57.260
Hey, what's wrong?

00:01:57.620 --> 00:01:59.520
My mom and dad...

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:01.500
They're here!

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:03.970
Cutemon's parents?

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:05.440
Cutemon's...

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:08.210
Dad!

00:02:08.210 --> 00:02:09.440
Mom!

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:18.950
Data... data...

00:02:17.710 --> 00:02:18.920
Cutemon!

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:26.130
Data... give us data...

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:25.640
Dorulumon!

00:02:26.130 --> 00:02:27.480
Who are they?

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:31.380
Data... Give us data!

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:28.390
They're Raremon.

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:32.780
They're the ones who took all 
the Digimon from the town.

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:36.590
Data... Give us data!

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:39.930
Don't tell me they threw 
everyone in the shredder!

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:42.110
I'll never forgive them!

00:02:42.110 --> 00:02:44.000
Mom... Dad...

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:46.940
We'll DigiXros and beat 
you all to a pulp!

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:48.880
Wait, Shoutmon.

00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:52.150
Finding the citizens 
is our first priority.

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:55.440
We've got to try to slip 
through them without fighting.

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:58.180
Slip through them?

00:02:58.180 --> 00:03:00.010
But we're already surrounded!

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:01.830
What do we do?!

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:04.200
You just...

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:04.890
...leave this...

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:06.400
...to us!

00:03:07.630 --> 00:03:10.090
We need a giant smokescreen.

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:11.260
Indeed.

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:12.100
That's huge...

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:14.670
Digi-Super Smokescreen!

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:17.560
But it's so big, we can't throw it.

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:18.380
Indeed.

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:28.690
Olé!

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:31.120
How naive,

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:33.170
to think that I would let 
you escape underground

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:34.360
without doing a thing about it.

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:37.700
You are far too naive.

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:40.410
But it is about time I used that...

00:03:47.970 --> 00:03:50.360
We managed to escape,

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:52.450
but darn those Monitamons!

00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:54.410
Where are the others?

00:03:54.410 --> 00:03:57.090
Taiki! Taiki, are you there?

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:58.020
Akari!

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.930
Thank goodness you're okay!

00:04:00.930 --> 00:04:03.210
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:04.360
Don't worry.

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:07.630
Dorulumon and Cutemon are with me, too.

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:12.500
I'm sorry. You got hurt because of me.

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:13.850
Don't worry about it.

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:18.330
You always heal my wounds for me, right?

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:20.140
So you don't have to worry.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:24.180
That leaves Zenjirou and Nene.

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:27.650
That's weird... I can't reach them.

00:04:28.090 --> 00:04:30.980
Maybe they're in a place 
with poor reception.

00:04:32.010 --> 00:04:34.040
Ow...

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.050
What is this place?

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:39.340
All these things are hanging everywhere.

00:04:40.490 --> 00:04:41.610
What are they?

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:50.370
Are they...

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:53.240
The Digimon from the town are all here?

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:57.710
Zenjirou! Zenjirou, can you hear me?

00:04:58.280 --> 00:04:59.820
Taiki Kudou!

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:01.510
Zenjirou! You're okay!

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:03.000
This isn't the time for that!

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:05.880
We just found something huge!

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:08.320
We found the citizens.

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:11.830
But they're all inside these weird 
packages hanging from the ceiling.

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:14.760
I'm pretty sure all the 
Zone's Digimon are here.

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:16.330
All the Zone's Digimon?

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:18.340
What do you mean?

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:20.330
What have they done to the citizens?

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:22.060
I don't know!

00:05:22.060 --> 00:05:25.390
But it looks like data is 
flowing out of the packages,

00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:28.110
and it's all being carried out somewhere.

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:30.980
So they're collecting the Digimon's data?

00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:35.020
Can't you save all of them now?

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:38.350
Look for my mom and dad!

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:41.690
I want you to find my mom and dad!

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:44.350
They're in here somewhere!

00:05:44.350 --> 00:05:46.060
I know they are!

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:56.480
They're turning into Raremon?!

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:04.880
We're getting out of here!

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:09.350
Don't leave me! Nene!

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:14.930
Zenjirou! Are you okay?!

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:19.790
What are they collecting 
the citizens' data for?

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:23.340
That thing above the shredder...

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:27.210
That's it! Something was 
pouring into there and...

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:32.310
Taiki, let's just go nuts 
on them with a DigiXros!

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:33.220
No, not yet!

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:34.540
What do you mean, "not yet"?

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:41.990
I knew it.

00:06:41.990 --> 00:06:44.420
They're collecting the 
citizens' data in there.

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:45.750
What?

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:49.370
It's glowing...

00:06:49.370 --> 00:06:51.250
I have a bad feeling...

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:53.320
like something terrible 
is about to happen.

00:06:59.510 --> 00:07:01.090
Once the test run is over,

00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:05.160
my system of power-up by
data injection will be perfected at last.

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:09.630
And when I present this perfect 
weapon to Lord Tactimon...

00:07:12.850 --> 00:07:18.030
The Sweets Zone will truly 
be my own sweets paradise!

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:19.850
Olé!

00:07:34.940 --> 00:07:37.310
That's Breakdramon!

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:39.880
Breakdramon?

00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:42.010
It's the ultimate destruction Digimon.

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:44.530
There are even rumors that the division

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:47.210
of the Digital World was his doing.

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:50.320
I never imagined he'd be in 
this Zone's underground...

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:54.000
We can't just sit around doing nothing!

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:56.390
Taiki, it's time to go nuts!

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:59.220
Yeah, this is the time.

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:03.630
Dorulumon, where are you? 
We have to DigiXros!

00:08:04.530 --> 00:08:06.330
Taiki! I'm here!

00:08:07.530 --> 00:08:09.470
Now if I can just get 
in touch with Nene...

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:12.690
It won't connect?

00:08:13.400 --> 00:08:17.180
If we don't have Sparrowmon's 
flying ability,

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:18.980
fighting in this situation will be...

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:51.470
There they are!

00:09:51.470 --> 00:09:53.980
We have no choice but to get started.

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:54.670
Wait!

00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:58.650
Don't you understand? 
They're the citizens of this Zone.

00:09:58.650 --> 00:10:00.250
We can't fight them.

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:03.350
You're saying you don't have 
the resolve to do that?

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:04.650
Resolve...

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:07.600
If you don't have resolve, 
you can't take even one step forward.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:12.860
You...

00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:15.130
I have my own sort of resolve.

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:21.500
Zenjirou, can you hear me?

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:22.920
Taiki!

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:24.830
We need Nene's help, right now.

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:26.500
Where are you?

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:27.390
Well, we're...

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:31.190
right beneath the shredder!

00:10:31.490 --> 00:10:33.490
Reload, Sparrowmon!

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:38.860
We're busting through, Nene!

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:39.920
Keep your head down!

00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:42.420
Are you serious? 
You're gonna bust through that?!

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:43.750
Head down!

00:10:52.230 --> 00:10:54.340
Are you okay, Sparrowmon?

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:56.500
Just a few scratches.

00:10:57.750 --> 00:10:59.800
Nene! I'm glad you're okay!

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:02.560
I'm ready anytime.

00:11:02.560 --> 00:11:03.750
Okay!

00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:05.140
Time to DigiXros!

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:10.050
Cutemon, hang tight.

00:11:11.140 --> 00:11:13.480
I'll save your parents, no matter what.

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.950
Trust me.

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:26.360
DigiXros!

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:36.250
Shoutmon!

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:37.350
Okay!

00:11:37.350 --> 00:11:38.210
Ballistamon!

00:11:39.480 --> 00:11:41.110
Dorulumon!

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:42.120
Starmons!

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:43.500
Yes!

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:45.980
Sparrowmon!

00:11:45.980 --> 00:11:47.610
DigiXros!

00:11:49.790 --> 00:11:52.190
Shoutmon X5!

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:56.560
Go, Shoutmon X5!

00:11:57.430 --> 00:11:59.890
Dive straight into the 
heart of that thing!

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:10.780
X5 has awesome defensive power, too!

00:12:17.730 --> 00:12:20.450
I can read your every move!

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:22.250
That's it, X5!

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:24.270
Slice the main body apart!

00:12:24.270 --> 00:12:26.490
Drag him down here!

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:27.640
Right!

00:12:33.050 --> 00:12:34.680
Too slow!

00:12:34.890 --> 00:12:36.930
Say your prayers!

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:48.310
We got him!

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:51.480
That was nothing!

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:00.890
Time for stage two of the test.

00:13:05.230 --> 00:13:07.030
Mom! Dad!

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:15.510
Mom! Dad!

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:21.450
This is the new power of Breakdramon.

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:22.810
Regeneration?!

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:25.750
So no attacks will work on him?

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:27.190
That power couldn't be...

00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:29.150
Breakdramon's power

00:13:29.150 --> 00:13:31.920
makes him the perfect ultimate weapon.

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:34.830
And now for the final stage of the test.

00:13:36.560 --> 00:13:38.700
Gravity Press!

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:46.570
Shoutmon X5! Don't give him 
a chance to counterattack!

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:48.110
Right! Leave this to me!

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:53.180
Meteor Buster Attack!

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:09.490
Make Xros Heart's bond burn bright!

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:16.010
Burn, Xros Heart!

00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:20.040
What? He's pushing 
back the Gravity Press

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.970
that destroys everything?!

00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:30.310
Mom! Dad!

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:33.120
Stop!

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:39.460
Stop!

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:41.490
My mom and dad are in there!

00:14:41.870 --> 00:14:43.860
They're gonna die!

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:45.030
Cutemon's...

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:46.430
Mom and dad?

00:14:46.430 --> 00:14:49.100
Save my parents!

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:53.860
So Cutemon's parents really are...

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:56.830
How naive...

00:14:56.830 --> 00:15:00.850
To fail to follow through 
before your attack hits home!

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:03.180
Infinity Boring!

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:11.420
Shoutmon X5!

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:18.840
This attack does not stop until 
it has crushed everything to dust.

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:30.980
Mom! Dad!

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:34.680
You mustn't come here.

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:41.160
You mustn't come here.

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:43.250
You cannot come here.

00:15:43.740 --> 00:15:45.220
Mom! Dad!

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:49.700
Our power is to heal those who are hurt.

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:53.330
Our power is for those who seek it.

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:56.230
I want to save you, Mom and Dad!

00:15:57.880 --> 00:16:01.610
Your friends need your power.

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:04.210
They need your help.

00:16:04.210 --> 00:16:07.440
So you must not come here.

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:13.070
But...

00:16:14.190 --> 00:16:16.320
I don't want to leave you!

00:16:16.320 --> 00:16:17.780
I don't...

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:19.210
You are so kind.

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:25.650
That kindness is our pride and joy.

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:27.320
You came all this way.

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:29.070
That's enough.

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:32.500
No tears, now. You're a boy, aren't you?

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:35.970
I'm... I'm...

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:39.250
I'm...

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:43.380
a boy...

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:48.140
I'm a boy!

00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:55.920
This light... Cutemon?

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:57.750
Yokunaol!

00:16:58.340 --> 00:17:01.130
My strength is slowly returning.

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:01.750
All right!

00:17:02.340 --> 00:17:04.680
Spadamon, help me out.

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:06.000
Right! I've been waiting for this!

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:08.630
Nene, Zenjirou, take over here!

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:09.980
Here we go!

00:17:09.980 --> 00:17:11.330
H-Hey, Taiki!

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:24.090
<i>We have to save Cutemon's 
parents, whatever it takes!</i>

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:27.260
Catch!

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:34.260
Spadamon, go for it!

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:34.970
Leave it to me!

00:17:45.420 --> 00:17:46.540
That was a close one.

00:17:54.790 --> 00:17:57.010
Okay, Shoutmon X5!

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:57.970
Your turn!

00:17:58.650 --> 00:18:03.490
Yeah! Thanks to Cutemon, 
I'm fully recharged!

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:09.920
What? He repelled Infinity Boring?!

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:11.230
Strike!

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:14.140
That's Team Xros Heart for you.

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:17.410
Partners who never give up, 
no matter what adversity they face.

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:21.610
Each member has the kind of 
resolve that gives you chills.

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:27.560
For your selfish actions in using the 
Zone's citizens for your own benefit,

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:32.390
and for using Cutemon's 
parents' abilities for evil...

00:18:32.390 --> 00:18:37.100
Our burning heart is shouting 
that it will never forgive you!

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:41.900
I'll beat you down with my own strength!

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:43.780
Butterfly Breaking Trumpet Kick!

00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:47.120
Meteor Impact!

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:57.880
This is for making Cutemon cry!

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:01.290
How naive...

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:03.040
The one who failed to 
follow through is...

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:05.030
Me! Olé!

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:12.560
We did it!

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:24.930
The citizens are returning 
to their original forms.

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:25.830
Yeah.

00:19:30.130 --> 00:19:31.830
Mom! Dad!

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:40.110
I'm so happy for Cutemon.

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:41.760
Taiki, is that...

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:44.090
The Code Crown!

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:48.560
Now peace will return to this Zone.

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:55.810
Even Matadormon and 
Breakdramon have fallen.

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:59.390
Enjoy your victory now, while you can.

00:19:59.390 --> 00:20:04.710
Next time, I will give you 
the gift of a perfect death.

00:20:11.370 --> 00:20:13.360
Are you sure, Cutemon?

00:20:13.800 --> 00:20:15.320
It's okay.

00:20:15.320 --> 00:20:19.060
Mom and Dad said I can 
continue my journey.

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:24.470
Mom...

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:32.680
Boys aren't supposed to cry!

00:20:34.230 --> 00:20:38.050
It's okay to cry when 
you have to, Cutemon.

00:20:38.050 --> 00:20:42.270
No, it's not! A boy can never, ever cry!

00:20:45.990 --> 00:20:46.510
All right...

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:49.860
Off to the next Zone!

